  "sn12.64:2.1": "Consciousness is organic, established or planted like a seed, for which see also <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn22.54/en/sujato'>SN 22.54</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an3.76/en/sujato'>AN 3.76</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an3.77/en/sujato'>AN 3.77</a>. ",
  "sn12.64:2.2": "",
  "sn12.64:2.3": "As an individual matures, they develop the capacity to make responsible moral decisions. ",
  "sn12.64:2.4": "Here choices in this life directly beget rebirth, which is normally stated as “consciousness”. ",
